// Sources:
// - Web Animations Level 1, W3C Editor's Draft,
//   https://drafts.csswg.org/web-animations-1/ (§6.4 "The Animation
//   interface", §6.5 "The AnimationEffect interface", §6.6 "The
//   KeyframeEffect interface", §6.7 "The Animatable interface mixin", §6.8
//   "Extensions to the Document interface"), copied on 2026-11-21;
// - CSS Animations Level 2, W3C Editor's Draft,
//   https://drafts.csswg.org/css-animations-2/ (§6.1 "The CSSAnimation
//   interface"), copied on 2026-11-21.
//
